  "body": "## Outcome\n\nRecasts MantleOS 2 as a generic autonomic nervous system and replaces the alpha.1 plugin-shaped Hermes experiment with direct, reversible source innervation.\n\n## Included\n\n- canonical PLAN.md project compass\n- substrate-neutral Body, Nerve, Book, Action, and physiology contracts\n- direct Hermes source nerves at five mapped semantic seams\n- private evidence-based Personality generation and explicit Primer approval\n- user-level resident Heart controls with explicit installation\n- checked-in pinned Hermes delta seed with apply/verify/reverse commands\n- local Git and GitHub source assimilation\n- updated privacy, release, CodeQL, and live-provider gates\n\n## Evidence\n\n- 37 framework tests pass\n- Ruff passes\n- public-tree audit passes\n- workflow YAML parses\n- pinned Hermes source compiles at all changed Python seams\n- real Windows seed apply, verify, and reverse returns a clean upstream checkout\n\nHermes runtime execution remains behind the separately required explicit sandbox gate. No organism was born and no private state or credential is included.",
